# Plugin exports dropped into the tree while working. Real Figma data is
# large (a token document runs to ~1.5 MB) and is not a repository artifact
# unless it has been deliberately curated as a fixture. Committing one by
# accident is how `tools/figma-tokens/json/` ended up carrying 3.5 MB of
# stale dumps, so the default is "ignored" and fixtures opt in explicitly.
*.ir.json
*.tokens.json
!fixtures/src/real-world/*.ir.json
!fixtures/src/real-world/*.tokens.json
!fixtures/src/corpus/**/*.ir.json
!codegen/tokens/testdata/minimal.tokens.json
!schema/fixtures/*.json
